### FilmFuse core-api - taste profile and vector history. Token: see me.http.
# status: NONE (no vector) | FRESH | REBUILDING (a newer taste signal is waiting; ~10-25 s).
# dimensions: every genre then every mood in the fixed vector order; stated = your sliders,
# learned = the vector's interpretable value (1 decimal). persona is cosmetic.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Taste profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/taste-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### How your taste changed: built versions, newest first (limit 1-50, default 20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/taste/history?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Taste editor: the sliders edit stated prefs through the same PUTs as onboarding (see onboarding.http)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me/preferences/genres
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{"genreId": 27, "score": 7}]
